    "opening": "Your freelance business plan needs to show what each assignment contributes, how many assignments fund your income and whether you have time to deliver them. A $500 assignment in this example leaves $435 after fees and direct expenses. Ten assignments cover the chosen monthly income goal, but the freelancer's available hours support only nine.",
